{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "591d90fa-b1dc-83b9-bada-6e1cd66a378e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:03:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:02:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, it's Colin Quinn. Sorry, I'm in the truck, engine's running, so if I cut out [line breaks up] bear with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:02:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you okay. What can I do for you, Colin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My recycling bin got left at the curb this morning with a tag on it. Rejected. Says rejected, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:02:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address where the bin is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:02:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Brewer Street. It's the shop, the business side. Well, it's both, but the bin's out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Did the tag say why it was rejected? There's usually a box checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, Thursday, I mean, yes, it's Thursday, that's my day. [inaudible] I didn't read the little boxes. Hang on. Something about contamination, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's usually things like bags inside the bin, greasy cardboard, or food containers that weren't rinsed. Crews leave it so you can pull those out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:03:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Is there a fee for that? Because I'm not paying to get my own trash looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:03:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's no charge for a rejected tag that I know of. Take the items out and put it out for the next pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:03:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's all I wanted. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Drive safe."
    }
  ],
